---
---
<section class="py-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-am-blue to-am-dark relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-am-accent/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Animated grid -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none"
    style="background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(10,132,255,0.2) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(10,132,255,0.2) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:60px 60px;animation:grid-move 20s linear infinite">
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center reveal">

      <!-- Title -->
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-8 leading-tight">
        Cuando el diseño se <span class="text-am-accent">entiende</span>, el producto <span class="text-am-yellow">avanza</span>
      </h2>

      <!-- Description -->
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-12 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Diseñamos experiencias digitales que equilibran estrategia, usabilidad
        e identidad visual. Desde mejoras puntuales hasta sistemas más robustos,
        buscamos que cada decisión de diseño tenga propósito y aporte valor real.
      </p>

      <!-- CTAs -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 justify-center items-center">
        <a href="/proyectos" class="inline-flex items-center bg-am-yellow text-am-dark font-semibold px-10 py-5 text-lg rounded-lg
                 shadow-lg shadow-am-yellow/20 hover:bg-am-yellow/90 transition-all duration-300 group">
          Ver proyectos
          <svg class="ml-2 w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/team" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-transparent border-2 border-am-accent
                 text-am-accent rounded-lg hover:bg-am-accent/10 transition-all duration-300 group text-lg font-semibold">
          Conocer nuestro equipo
          <svg class="ml-2 w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
